: "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827867_589180484142828_266929031235457912_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yEtceU8SupIQ7kNvwFnWFJq&_nc_oc=Adp6uBZ773RBYaIuAW9inIgsKmHiBeEkU8C1sgXLJYWTNuhHre4pKIaxQo8rRaStLcc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2gF2Ug5SFWmpMllnbITcw4kLoR9QkQxzdmE8x6b-IeNA&oe=69F0D205"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_0000_Screenshot-2025-04-10-113143.png", "id": "1176925730331466", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827725_1176925733664799_3790371368702893484_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sn42AeDl4y4Q7kNvwElIZI5&_nc_oc=AdqCX78yLHUWaCWZy0-4p17CNtg-BrLIDiwDCtXeCmcpN4eA-isPz8xaQ0Mb6u0YRUY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0UYMr-YX2do98k0fBypxIMM5IGJekfkDMP3ZKJdVkeTQ&oe=69F09D4E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_0003_Screenshot-2025-04-10-112403.png", "id": "1018396219679557", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828895_1018396223012890_5107840577383576045_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=thFHEdB7WGQQ7kNvwGGWZBW&_nc_oc=Adrkvg5S_mfWXXJu5L5jgxQJ_RElaXUOrAu3t1W5x4lQ_o2GLtA85alGNZjgCQD_Jg8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3dfOSoPPZeA5Z0_qlu3QC-VGrtzFBls7vgK11c_IylYw&oe=69F0A1B8"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_0004_Screenshot-2025-04-10-112719.png", "id": "2091812787933632", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830787_2091812791266965_7439820487698740197_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W7odQp56KoEQ7kNvwHHoE8r&_nc_oc=AdpuZMeNx4WBC5BG3QaklHMrBGeV5V6nCxwQCVHsKuzqJOEFETTBa6mHNQgQETfLr70&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3fKwPchTbhysglVgCRj0E5gHCUJV7svgemhotClP9AWQ&oe=69F0A6E7"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_0001_Screenshot-2025-04-10-113005.png", "id": "1391575151856032", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827031_1391575158522698_4796616866213924747_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VEtT_onzefkQ7kNvwF8sHYW&_nc_oc=AdrAid4iNHvqsfd0wbjhEM8RCsK1jc2AIFVPqPbBtczX5ZK5qHyiGMlaP7Aa6nYCuLk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1ivYBvlan-RRK6zDhHauav-_oI5Zv6K57ocwj-xxQeMg&oe=69F0B5B1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "COVER TRAILER.png", "id": "2021730704977200", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824556_2021730708310533_6538207973128942507_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jvdh-DAPIkoQ7kNvwGCW817&_nc_oc=Adps2BFYPIXwmobhG_uNKGYKHyhMjWx41UEslpxpYnQepVHdIS-R34Uiv1Voo03oVNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af30IXnVMjEeEx_fyuH8TAI4q0SD93WC6HRamhWkk6O1ZA&oe=69F0B999"}, "display_name": "San Paolo Vecchio - Hidden Frescoes", "keywords": ["Affreschi", "Assorestauro", "BSOD", "San", "Paolo"], "long_description": "**San Paolo Vecchio - Hidden Frescoes - VR**\n\nStep into history like never before. Explore and uncover hidden masterpieces within the Church of San Paolo, a jewel in the heart of Ferrara. This app offers you a unique immersive experience, blending art and virtual reality technology to reveal precious frescoes that have remained hidden for centuries behind the walls of time.\n\n**Become the protagonist!**\n\nThanks to ultra-high-definition 3D scans and photogrammetric reconstructions, you'll virtually navigate the ancient spaces of the church. Reveal hidden frescoes, learn artistic and historical details, and relive the fascinating work of restorers.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n- **Full Immersion:** Use your Meta Quest headset for an incredibly realistic journey back in time.\n- **Active Interaction:** Use intuitive virtual tools to discover details invisible to the naked eye.\n- **Guided Narration:** Deepen your understanding of the frescoes and the history of Ferrara through engaging storytelling filled with historical insights and interesting facts.\n\n**Ideal for:**\n\n- History, art, and culture enthusiasts.\n- Students and researchers looking for an interactive learning experience.\n- Tourists preparing for or extending their physical visits to Ferrara\u2019s historical sites.\n\nDiscover a unique cultural heritage. With \"San Paolo Vecchio - Hidden Frescoes,\" experience the past firsthand and virtually contribute to preserving historical memory.\n\n**Install now and start your journey through time!**\n", "short_description": "Explore hidden frescoes, ancient chapels, and unveiled miracles. With this immersive VR experience, become a restorer for a day and uncover the secrets of Ferrara\u2019s cultural heritage like never before. Discover and reveal history in an interactive journey blending art, history, and technology.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "pano_test_lowres.png", "id": "1937208813750082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825045_1937208817083415_2308131944780557392_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0lWgFWZ_QfMQ7kNvwG-A8H5&_nc_oc=Adp83kyh7tduoUJHk2sGjSy5cCZCVXEcP5znEaDa0wu4y9GAO07D6BM8fbB_-CP0hTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1H8C3iXHkZLQ6Z83-B7VxLMTuPAkVc8GGoFFdjTwsB7A&oe=69F0D0F6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateHero_SANPAOLO_1.png", "id": "1751691975409010", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824504_1751691978742343_6280807670428162182_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_7Yu4xFZN5YQ7kNvwEIaHNJ&_nc_oc=AdrmXXzhw8TdLrwodO-dGJdMmriH8CI9X4s3qheTep-AxJBEaP_rqY8SwlS9S7nIZWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1HOYqzlnlKKXl-eJiYRPNrqrNKLmArDIqoxhgvX6EcPQ&oe=69F0B414"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_SANPAOLO.png", "id": "1243210453909475", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824513_1243210457242808_4833206868291161260_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P6s5zDBdub4Q7kNvwEdohOZ&_nc_oc=Adomq